{
  "_comment": "READ-ONLY leg profile. R61: a leg declared read-only in legs.json was read-only BY INSTRUCTION ONLY. On 2026-07-26 a read-only extraction fleet edited five schema files, twice rewrote a test file including overwriting the orchestrator's own work, and kept writing for four minutes after the workflow was stopped. Article I says enforcement belongs in the definition, not the instruction. This file is that enforcement. A read-only leg still needs to write its own receipt, so harness/notes/** is the ONLY writable path.",
